#   tokenizer_3 - CSS::Parser::Tokenizer: consume a token, and the input's byte offsets
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/Tokenizer.cpp (lines 964-1242: consume_a_token,
#       current_byte_offset, input_since).
